{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_graphify_graphify", "label": "graphify \u2014 grafo de conocimiento como capa 0 de recuperaci\u00f3n", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/GRAPHIFY.md", "source_location": "L1-L278", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_graphify_level_zero_five", "label": "Nivel 0.5 de la jerarqu\u00eda de coste", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/GRAPHIFY.md", "source_location": "L10-L25", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "El grafo responde sin leer: devuelve un subgrafo acotado por --budget en vez de 40 archivos, y ese coste no se vuelve a pagar porque update es AST puro. Grep sigue siendo lo correcto para localizar una l\u00ednea exacta que ya sabes que quieres tocar."}, {"id": "docs_graphify_claude_cli_backend", "label": "Backend de LLM `claude-cli`", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/GRAPHIFY.md", "source_location": "L64-L76", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "No hay API key en la m\u00e1quina y la clave de Anthropic devuelve 'credit balance too low', as\u00ed que la pasada sem\u00e1ntica enruta por el binario claude local y se factura al plan ya pagado; Ollama queda como fallback de coste literalmente cero a cambio de peor extracci\u00f3n."}, {"id": "docs_graphify_three_graphs", "label": "Los tres grafos (NEPTUNO, ANDROMEDA, global)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/GRAPHIFY.md", "source_location": "L80-L93", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_graphify_graphifyignore", "label": "Los dos `.graphifyignore` obligatorios", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/GRAPHIFY.md", "source_location": "L95-L98", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Excluir .opencode/ evita duplicar cada skill y agente como nodos gemelos que envenenar\u00edan la detecci\u00f3n de comunidades; excluir 04-Recursos/Grafo/ evita que la b\u00f3veda ingiera su propio export y se realimente consigo misma."}, {"id": "docs_graphify_hook_guard", "label": "Hook PreToolUse `graphify hook-guard`", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/GRAPHIFY.md", "source_location": "L102-L126", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Modo nudge suave: inyecta contexto y nunca bloquea, fallando abierto ante cualquier error. El aviso de lectura incluye expl\u00edcitamente a los subagentes, porque un scout que grepea a ciegas es exactamente el gasto que graphify elimina."}, {"id": "docs_graphify_sync_traps", "label": "Dos trampas de sincronizaci\u00f3n", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/GRAPHIFY.md", "source_location": "L130-L137", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "sync-global.js hace rmSync sobre ~/.claude/skills y sobrescribe la clave hooks del settings global, as\u00ed que tanto la skill como los hooks deben vivir en el maestro .claude/ y no instalarse directo en el global."}, {"id": "docs_graphify_ast_only_update", "label": "`update` es AST puro", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/GRAPHIFY.md", "source_location": "L156-L180", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "No llama al LLM y cuesta cero, pero ANDROMEDA tiene 0 archivos de c\u00f3digo y NEPTUNO 88 docs frente a 10 de c\u00f3digo: en estos repos el ciclo barato de mantenimiento casi no aplica y refrescar exige la pasada sem\u00e1ntica completa."}, {"id": "docs_graphify_chunk_size_density_bias", "label": "Sesgo de densidad por tama\u00f1o de chunk", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/GRAPHIFY.md", "source_location": "L182-L201", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Los mismos archivos extra\u00eddos con menos compa\u00f1\u00eda en el chunk producen muchos m\u00e1s nodos porque el token-budget se reparte: el grafo queda m\u00e1s denso donde se ha tocado recientemente e inclina query hacia lo \u00faltimo editado."}, {"id": "docs_graphify_feedback_loop", "label": "Bucle de realimentaci\u00f3n (`save-result` / `reflect`)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/GRAPHIFY.md", "source_location": "L205-L217", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "reflect agrega las se\u00f1ales de forma determinista, con vida media de 30 d\u00edas y exigiendo corroboraci\u00f3n de 2 resultados distintos: ataca el acierto y no solo el gasto."}, {"id": "docs_graphify_sensitive_filename_filter", "label": "Filtro de archivos sensibles por nombre", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/GRAPHIFY.md", "source_location": "L236-L264", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Un .md queda exento salvo que su stem sea exactamente una palabra clave (fullmatch): TOKENS.md se descartaba en silencio y por eso la doc se renombr\u00f3 a ECONOMIA-TOKENS.md; un an\u00e1lisis basado solo en el nombre de la funci\u00f3n habr\u00eda concluido lo contrario."}, {"id": "docs_graphify_mcp_not_registered", "label": "Decisi\u00f3n de no registrar el MCP de graphify", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/GRAPHIFY.md", "source_location": "L60", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Sus 10 herramientas se cargar\u00edan en el contexto de cada sesi\u00f3n (~1-1,5k tokens) para hacer lo mismo que el CLI hace desde Bash a coste de contexto cero."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_graphify_graphify", "target": "docs_graphify_level_zero_five", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/GRAPHIFY.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_graphify_graphify", "target": "docs_graphify_claude_cli_backend", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/GRAPHIFY.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_graphify_graphify", "target": "docs_graphify_three_graphs", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/GRAPHIFY.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_graphify_graphify", "target": "docs_graphify_graphifyignore", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/GRAPHIFY.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_graphify_graphify", "target": "docs_graphify_hook_guard", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/GRAPHIFY.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_graphify_graphify", "target": "docs_graphify_sync_traps", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/GRAPHIFY.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_graphify_graphify", "target": "docs_graphify_ast_only_update", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/GRAPHIFY.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_graphify_graphify", "target": "docs_graphify_chunk_size_density_bias", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/GRAPHIFY.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_graphify_graphify", "target": "docs_graphify_feedback_loop", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/GRAPHIFY.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_graphify_graphify", "target": "docs_graphify_sensitive_filename_filter", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/GRAPHIFY.md",